[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32600100_02_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32600100_02_0001","text":"制作人"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32600100_02_0010","text":"这次的概念，决定要针对年轻群体做有冲击力的东西。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32600100_02_0020","text":"目标就是，把年轻人郁结的内心用强有力的方式表现出来，获得共鸣。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32600100_02_0030","text":"唉…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32600100_02_0040","text":"所以打算找符合形象的艺人来做——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32600100_02_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32600100_02_0050","text":"路加…………？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32600100_02_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32600100_02_0052","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32600100_02_0060","text":"啊啊啊啊啊啊…………————————"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32600100_02_0070","text":"这种东西，\n最容易火啊————"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32600100_02_0080","text":"你们啊…………\n这样就行了吗…………？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32600100_02_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32600100_02_0090","text":"你一直发呆，没事吧…………？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32600100_02_0100","text":"啊……没什么…………\n什么都没有…………………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32600100_02_0101","text":"Motion"}]
